# 🌐 Website Auditor

A full-stack web application that audits any website URL and generates a quick SEO and performance report. Users can enter a URL, and the application fetches the webpage, analyzes its content, and displays useful metrics such as HTTP status, response time, page title, meta description, heading count, image accessibility, and approximate word count.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 🔍 Audit any publicly accessible website
- ⚡ Measure HTTP response time
- 📄 Extract page title
- 📝 Extract meta description
- 📌 Count H1 headings
- 🖼️ Detect images missing `alt` attributes
- 📚 Calculate approximate word count
- ❌ Handles invalid URLs gracefully
- ⏱️ Handles request timeouts
- 📄 Detects non-HTML responses
- 🎨 Clean and responsive React frontend
- 🔗 REST API built with Express.js

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend
- React.js
- Vite
- Axios
- CSS

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- Axios
- Cheerio
- CORS

